me", "content": "You're the best."}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to tell someone you appreciate them"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: I can look after your cat.  <span class=\"strong\">Ben</span>: You're the best."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in conversations between friends."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to travel the world"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to travel to many different countries"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to travel the world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "suitcase "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large bag to put your clothes in when you travel "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to buy a new suitcase for my trip."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "away "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be out of town"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you look after my cat when I'm away?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look after "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take care of someone or something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you look after my cat?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le04ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are going on a vacation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue making requests to your friend. (For example: <span class=\"italic\">Can you look after my cat? dog? plants?</span>)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles and practice again."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I show interest and surprise."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a short dialogue."}]}], "type": "sena"}